#: widgets/administratorsettingsdialog/cas/cassettingswidget.cpp:50
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"When enabled, Rocket.Chat will trust that any username from CAS belongs to "
"the same user on Rocket.Chat.\n"
"This may be needed if a user is renamed on CAS, but may also allow people to "
"take control of Rocket.Chat accounts by renaming their own CAS users."
msgstr "Ako je omogućeno, Rocket.Chat će vjerovati da svako korisničko ime iz CAS-a pripada istom korisniku na Rocket.Chat.\nTo može biti potrebno ako se korisniku promijeni ime u CAS-u, ali može omogućiti i preuzimanje kontrole nad Rocket.Chat računima promjenom vlastitog CAS korisničkog imena."

#: widgets/administratorsettingsdialog/cas/cassettingswidget.cpp:55
