#, kde-format
msgid "Attribute handling"
msgstr "Obrada atributa"

#: widgets/administratorsettingsdialog/cas/cassettingswidget.cpp:65
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Always synchronize external CAS User data into available attributes upon "
"login.\n"
"Note: Attributes are always synced upon account creation anyway."
msgstr "Uvijek sinkroniziraj vanjske CAS korisničke podatke s dostupnim atributima pri prijavi.\nNapomena: Atributi se ionako uvijek sinkroniziraju pri stvaranju računa."

#: widgets/administratorsettingsdialog/cas/cassettingswidget.cpp:69
#, kde-format
msgid "Attribute Map"
msgstr "Mapiranje atributa"

#: widgets/administratorsettingsdialog/cas/cassettingswidget.cpp:71
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Use this JSON input to build internal attributes (key) from external "
"attributes (value).\n"
"External attribute names enclosed with '%' will interpolated in value "
"strings.<br/>Example, {\"email\":\"%email%\", \"name\":\"%firstname%, "
"%lastname%\"}\n"
"The attribute map is always interpolated. In CAS 1.0 only the username "
"attribute is available. Available internal attributes are: username, name, "
"email, rooms;\n"
"rooms is a comma separated list of rooms to join upon user creation e.g: "
"{\"rooms\": \"%team%,%department%\"} would join CAS users on creation to "
"their team and department channel."
msgstr "Upotrijebite ovaj JSON unos za stvaranje internih atributa (ključ) iz vanjskih atributa (vrijednost).\nNazivi vanjskih atributa omeđeni znakom „%” umeću se u vrijednosti niza.<br/>Primjer: {\"email\":\"%email%\", \"name\":\"%firstname%, %lastname%\"}\nMapiranje atributa uvijek se interpolira. U CAS-u 1.0 dostupan je samo atribut korisničkog imena. Dostupni interni atributi su: username, name, email, rooms;\nrooms je popis soba odvojenih zarezima kojima se korisnik pridružuje pri stvaranju računa, npr.: {\"rooms\": \"%team%,%department%\"} pridružit će korisnike CAS-a njihovom timu i kanalu odjela pri stvaranju računa."

